Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.05,0:00:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.41,0:00:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.67,0:01:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.09,0:01:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My mind must be playing tricks on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.33,0:01:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.91,0:01:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My card seems to be doing\Nthe same thing, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.19,0:01:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels as though these three\Ndragons are calling out to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.15,0:01:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I was told that fate\Nhad chosen three modern
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.31,0:01:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-day warriors to release\Nthese legendary beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.05,0:01:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Chosen by fate? Get real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.65,0:01:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who decides my fate, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.47,0:01:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Not some fairy tale about mythical\Ndragons and giant man-eating monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.19,0:01:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Be reasonable for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.41,0:01:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The world needs us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.27,0:01:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We must do this as a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.97,0:01:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I don't do the\Nteamwork thing. Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.91,0:01:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You geeks have wasted\Nenough of my time already.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.09,0:01:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a multi-million\Ndollar company to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.29,0:01:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Playtime's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.63,0:02:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.79,0:02:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto! Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.17,0:02:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need him weighing us down anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.05,0:02:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,With good ol' Hamos over here,\Nthose hoodlums won't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.61,0:02:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's back to their old self again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.79,0:02:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,About time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.11,0:02:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It took me a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.61,0:02:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but I realize being bummed out about\NMai's not gonna bring her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.27,0:02:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Your track record stinks, Weevil,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.39,0:02:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,so why should I believe there\Nare more rare cards in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.21,0:02:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm the smart one, and\Nyou're just a goofy sidekick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.97,0:02:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, what are you guys up to over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.47,0:02:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My glasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.69,0:02:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't find my glasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.37,0:02:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, they're right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.53,0:02:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Where you just threw them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.31,0:02:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.55,0:02:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So now that we know who's\Ncausing this whole mess,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.35,0:02:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,what are we supposed to do about it, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.79,0:02:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We find this thoughts guy and his\Ngoon squad, and we rescue Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.99,0:03:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, they split without leaving\Nan address, so that's not going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.27,0:03:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.45,0:03:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Plan B, anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.11,0:03:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We could chill out back at my crib,\Nplay a little Dungeon Dice Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.61,0:03:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.07,0:03:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor Hawkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.35,0:03:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He lives around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.77,0:03:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He may have some new\Ninformation that could help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.51,0:03:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Good call.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.71,0:03:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He did say he was going\Nback home to continue
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.11,0:03:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,his research on the lost\Ncity of Atlantis. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.43,0:03:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have a feeling his discovery\Nis somehow related to our new enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.59,0:03:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.50,0:03:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We know where we're\Ngoing, but what about how?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.11,0:03:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.33,0:03:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Flag him down or something! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.71,0:03:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.69,0:03:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We need a lift, rich boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.03,0:04:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well so much for that\Nidea, dude. No sweat, we'll
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.23,0:04:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,just take my car cool but\Nare you sure we can all
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.49,0:04:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,fit in there the five\Nof us can squeeze in no
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.91,0:04:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,problem hello what about\Nus why are you two guys
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.33,0:04:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,here anyway. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.19,0:04:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a spot for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.51,0:04:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good to be traveling in style again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.03,0:04:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure you're not holding\Nthat map upside down?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.49,0:04:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you please zip it? Unless you want
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.09,0:04:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,to join those dorks in the trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.17,0:04:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we just take that blue line?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.99,0:04:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If we had a boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.55,0:04:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue lines are rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.95,0:04:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Duh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.99,0:04:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to get Mai back on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.71,0:04:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I was sick of my life,\Nso I chose to change it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.31,0:04:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.63,0:04:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.97,0:04:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you guys would never understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.69,0:05:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never been an outsider like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.41,0:05:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't need any help from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.69,0:05:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,All I need now is power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.95,0:05:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm about to unleash all of it on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.15,0:05:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you the Mai you knew is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.73,0:05:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I never knew Mai was so unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.27,0:05:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I knew she wanted to be the best,\Nbut I can't believe she took it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.57,0:05:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Joining some evil plot\Nto destroy civilization?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.69,0:05:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Based on what Pegasus said, Darts controls\Na magic force that's 10,000 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.09,0:05:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's even older than you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.25,0:05:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.31,0:05:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The Orakalkos.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.71,0:05:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And it appears to be more powerful\Nthan any magic we've ever experienced.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.67,0:05:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it seems to be connected\Nto Professor Hawkins' discovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.11,0:05:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope he can tell us what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.51,0:05:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.67,0:05:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just about to finish off, Wheeler,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.29,0:06:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and then you had to butt in\Nand ruin everything. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.69,0:06:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Valon, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.95,0:06:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,With this fragment of the Oracle\NCoast Stone, I unlocked the seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.05,0:06:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,you're a real piece of work he\Nsaved your soul and this is how you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.93,0:06:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,repay him who asked to be saved\Nmaybe next time he'll learn to butt
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.81,0:06:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,out next time we'll just let you\Nlose that's enough mate i'm fine yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.15,0:06:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,clam up or you'll end up just like\Nyour friend here you have no idea
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.95,0:06:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The danger you were in. Do you\Nremember that Hermos card, Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.33,0:06:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,played it's an ancient dragon that\Ncan only be controlled by a chosen
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.63,0:06:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,duelist ha yeah he was chosen all\Nright chosen to have that scrawny
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.35,0:06:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,butt of his kicked by a real duelist
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.03,0:07:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,later losers hey white that's mine
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.17,0:07:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,you won't escape me this time wheeler
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.25,0:07:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let Mai get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.39,0:07:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.91,0:07:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.23,0:07:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's focus on the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.63,0:07:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Darts said to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.35,0:07:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, Master Darts\Ndoesn't always know what's best.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.51,0:07:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We should take the strongest soul first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.89,0:07:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we get him out of the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.73,0:07:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,the others will fall right\Ninto our hands one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.45,0:07:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But how do you know the Pharaoh will duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.67,0:07:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Because my plan is already in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.93,0:07:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.15,0:07:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.33,0:07:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,In all of these ancient paintings,\None image appears over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.55,0:07:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.79,0:08:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm stumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.67,0:08:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Copernicus!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.49,0:08:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.59,0:08:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Copernicus, what's gotten into you, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.09,0:08:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I load you up with too\Nmany groceries today or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.05,0:08:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the helicopter doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.29,0:08:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa's not expecting\Nany visitors today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.01,0:08:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.97,0:08:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.21,0:08:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it down, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.91,0:08:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.15,0:08:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You should stay out of things\Nthat don't concern you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.15,0:08:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.23,0:08:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let my grandpa go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.05,0:08:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.57,0:09:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.49,0:09:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa's laboratory!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.91,0:09:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What do they want with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.35,0:09:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.01,0:09:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A dual monster's card?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.15,0:09:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.99,0:09:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure this is the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.21,0:09:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor Hawkins! Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.29,0:09:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.65,0:09:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.56,0:09:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.65,0:09:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, they took him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My poor grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.29,0:09:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.21,0:10:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't hurt anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.17,0:10:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.71,0:10:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.07,0:10:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.11,0:10:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would do something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.79,0:10:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I still don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.39,0:10:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would kidnap the professor?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.05,0:10:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It had to be Dots.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.71,0:10:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Or his gang of thugs, anyway. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.43,0:10:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, the guy's just an archaeologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.79,0:10:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But didn't you guys say he\Nmade some big discovery?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.53,0:10:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he found Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.65,0:10:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca, I've got an idea. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.15,0:10:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember that stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.67,0:10:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The one I gave to your grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.93,0:10:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I have it around\Nmy neck, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.97,0:10:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Gramps told me to hang on to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.33,0:10:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's what Darts\Nand his lackeys are after.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.51,0:10:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Then be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.93,0:10:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.95,0:11:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy, let's find out where\Nthis Darts guy hangs out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.21,0:11:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We bust in and get Hawkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.97,0:11:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.31,0:11:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think they're\Nlisted in the phone book.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.83,0:11:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.37,0:11:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, he doesn't have what they want,\Nwhich means they'll probably come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.31,0:11:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.22,0:11:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So we just sit on our butts and wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.13,0:11:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I still like my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.67,0:11:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're gonna stay here, I gotta eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.13,0:11:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait on an\Nempty stomach, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.69,0:11:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.60,0:11:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll whip something up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.67,0:11:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not eating anything you cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.19,0:11:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.27,0:11:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna bring your\Ngrandpa back soon, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.17,0:11:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Bam!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.08,0:11:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Smells delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.71,0:11:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tristan, is the table set yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.51,0:11:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost done, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.73,0:11:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Any time you want to jump\Nin and help would be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.67,0:11:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.51,0:11:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.89,0:11:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Weevil and Rex?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.77,0:11:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I forgot about\Nthose two. Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.05,0:11:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,More food for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.63,0:12:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,For the last time,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.41,0:12:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no rare cards here. Just\Nkeep looking. Have I been wrong yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.31,0:12:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, about everything Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.81,0:12:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.77,0:12:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit standing around and keep looking,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.57,0:12:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Rex, this old guy has no\Nrare cards. He's a professor,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.13,0:12:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,not a duelist Quit\Nwhining I haven't eaten in
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.63,0:12:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,like five days My stomach\Nwon't stop rumbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.17,0:12:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Some french fries would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.53,0:12:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So what'd you want to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.57,0:12:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just scared, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.39,0:12:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole thing is so strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.67,0:12:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but we'll find your gramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.03,0:12:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm, there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.31,0:12:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.79,0:12:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The creeps who kidnapped my\Ngrandfather left it behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.79,0:12:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It came with a note.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.63,0:13:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting for you in Death Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.45,0:13:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll show up if you want to\Nsee your friend again, Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.77,0:13:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.68,0:13:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How far away is Death Valley?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.09,0:13:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if we use Duke's car, it shouldn't\Ntake us more than an hour or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.39,0:13:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Rebecca, but I\Nhave to go alone. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.01,0:13:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I've put you and your family\Nin enough danger already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.45,0:13:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.36,0:13:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.57,0:13:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,None of this is your fault at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.05,0:13:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.11,0:13:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's me they want, and\Nyou'll be much safer here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.19,0:13:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And please don't tell the other\Nguys where I'm about to go, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.71,0:13:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.85,0:13:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want them to follow me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.29,0:13:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.77,0:13:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise and shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.53,0:13:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.63,0:13:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.33,0:13:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What is important is that you\Nforget everything you've discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.57,0:14:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, those ruins are a piece of\Nhistory and they don't belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.39,0:14:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you get that stone you're\Nwearing around your neck, young man?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.27,0:14:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's made of the same material\NI discovered in those ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.95,0:14:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like someone's too\Ncurious for their own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.63,0:14:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were you, I'd wise up and\Nstop my research, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.37,0:14:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're not me, and I've waited\Nmy entire career to find this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.23,0:14:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never abandon my\Nresearch, is that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.83,0:14:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.61,0:14:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.89,0:14:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We've burned down your laboratory and\Ndestroyed everything you've found.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.19,0:14:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you're no longer a threat to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.07,0:14:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The time draws near, great Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.13,0:14:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,With every soul you receive,\Nyour power grows. Soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.21,0:15:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll unleash your rage upon mankind, and\Nwe'll finish what we began so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.13,0:15:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The storm gets stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.97,0:15:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Radio for help!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.49,0:15:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The system's down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.39,0:15:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, the light bulb!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.57,0:15:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I know what I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.33,0:15:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to face these creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.37,0:15:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.41,0:16:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Rebecca. I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.95,0:16:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, Copernicus?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.31,0:16:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't sleep either, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.37,0:16:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's Yook?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.03,0:16:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, um, uh, I promised I wouldn't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.79,0:16:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca, how could you let\Nhim just leave like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.91,0:17:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, Joey, it's not her fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.37,0:17:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys would have done the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.81,0:17:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we would have talked\Nsome sense into him, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.87,0:17:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Yook.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.67,0:17:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.29,0:17:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.35,0:17:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, man, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.41,0:17:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor Hawkins!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.87,0:17:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.05,0:17:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.05,0:17:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca, where is Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.05,0:17:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy must want to duel us, right? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.39,0:17:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we have our Timaeus\Ncard, we should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.67,0:17:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But he holds the seal of Orycalcos.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.43,0:17:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but we have something else over him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.73,0:18:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,A belief in the heart of the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.99,0:18:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're back, Gramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.93,0:18:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Paya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.05,0:18:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll find Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.25,0:18:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You hold down the fort till we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.91,0:18:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, just be careful, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.23,0:18:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.97,0:18:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep an eye out for Rex and Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.15,0:18:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't trust those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.11,0:18:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't miss the showdown\Nbetween Yugi and those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.89,0:18:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to find out how they made\NMayan to such a strong duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.39,0:18:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we take a quick snack break?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.81,0:18:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.93,0:18:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He's getting ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.73,0:18:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.64,0:18:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Put the pedal to the metal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.25,0:18:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.09,0:19:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.27,0:19:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.77,0:19:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.29,0:19:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready for you, Pharaoh, thanks\Nto my deck and the power it holds.
